  "title": "Broadstone Net Lease Announces $303 Million Build-to-Suit Development for a Fortune 20 Investment-Grade Company",
  "summary": "VICTOR, N.Y. – Broadstone Net Lease, Inc. (NYSE: BNL) (“BNL”, the “Company”, “we”, “our”, or “us”), today announced that it has added a new development project to its pipeline of build-to-suit commitments, entering into a joint venture to develop an advanced technology facility in Colorado. BNL’s estimated total investment in the project is approximately $303 […]",
